# Internal working notes, kept local and out of the repo by decision
# (2026-11-08). These are the build's own reasoning and scratch documents,
# not part of what is deployed or handed over: the deliverable is SOLUTION.md
# exported to PDF, plus the prototype link.
#
# None of this reaches the container either - `.dockerignore` already drops
# `notes/` and every `*.md`, so untracking them cannot affect a build.
notes/
DECISIONS.md
SOLUTION.md
START_HERE.md
my_findings.md
